# Per-binary B2_INTEGRATION_TESTS evidence

This directory holds per-binary cargo test logs from
`scripts/gate/run_b2_per_binary.py`.

Each file is the captured stdout+stderr of a single
`cargo test --test <bin> --all-features` invocation, used to triage failures
into:

- **true regression** (something in `develop/` HEAD regressed)
- **stale harness** (e.g. test references `BinaryTableStorageV2` which was
  renamed by PR #4417 — see disabled registry entries 34, 35)
- **perf-only** (binary is correct but takes >30s — see
  `b2-perf-test-exclusion-registry.md`)
- **external fixture** (e.g. mysql-server legacy binary not available on dev)

Files are overwritten on each B2 run. Retention: 5 most-recent runs, prune on
rollover.

`.gitkeep` preserved so the directory exists before the first B2 run.